{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02784","headline":"狱中学骚体 · 卢照邻","name":"狱中学骚体","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夫何秋夜之无情兮，皎皛悠悠而太长。\n圜户杳其幽邃兮，愁人披此严霜。\n见河汉之西落，闻鸿雁之南翔。\n山有桂兮桂有芳，心思君兮君不将。\n忧与忧兮相积，欢与欢兮两忘。\n风嫋嫋兮木纷纷，凋绿叶兮吹白云。\n寸步千里兮不相闻，思公子兮日将曛。\n林已暮兮鸟羣飞，重门掩兮人径稀。\n万族皆有所托兮，蹇独淹留而不归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02784.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02784","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}